# Dev 环境部署（develop 分支）

## 快速部署

```bash
ssh ubuntu@133.242.179.110
cd /home/ubuntu/project/fulfillment-service
./scripts/dev/deploy-from-git.sh
```

## 手动部署步骤

### 步骤 1: 拉取最新代码

```bash
ssh ubuntu@133.242.179.110
cd /home/ubuntu/project/fulfillment-service

# 保存本地修改（如有）
git stash

# 切换到 develop 分支并拉取
git checkout develop
git pull origin develop
```

### 步骤 2: 同步代码到部署目录

```bash
rsync -avz --delete \
    --exclude '.git' \
    --exclude 'node_modules' \
    --exclude '.next' \
    --exclude 'backend/.venv' \
    --exclude 'backend/logs' \
    --exclude 'deployment/environments/env.prod' \
    --exclude 'deployment/environments/frontend/env.prod' \
    --exclude 'docker-compose.prod.yml' \
    /home/ubuntu/project/fulfillment-service/ /opt/supplynexus/
```

### 步骤 3: 重启 Dev 服务

```bash
cd /opt/supplynexus
docker-compose -f docker-compose.dev.yml down
docker-compose -f docker-compose.dev.yml up -d --build --remove-orphans
```

### 步骤 4: 验证部署

```bash
# 检查容器状态
docker-compose -f docker-compose.dev.yml ps

# 检查健康状态
curl http://localhost:8001/api/v1/health
curl http://localhost:3001/api/health
```

## Dev 环境服务地址

- 前端: https://admin.dev.supplynexus.store
- 后端 API: https://api.dev.supplynexus.store

